Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episod}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:00.73,0:00:03.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tsuda, mi-a ajuns la urechi faptul că \Nți-ai cumpărat un robot sexual. E adevărat?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:03.98,0:00:05.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doamnă director, eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:05.32,0:00:08.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spune-mi că nu ești un \Nastfel de criminal, Tsuda.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:08.28,0:00:09.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stați, nu este așa...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.41,0:00:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E în regulă, stăpână.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:12.62,0:00:15.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vom putea fi împreună pe vecie acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:22.71,0:00:23.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fost doar un vis.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:26.67,0:00:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uite cât de liniștit doarme.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.84,0:00:33.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stai, dar roboții nu dorm.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.55,0:00:36.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-a stricat?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:37.22,0:00:39.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate a rămas fără baterie?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A stat {\i1}pornită{\i0} încă \Nde când a ajuns aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.15,0:00:46.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun, ar trebui să fie în regulă acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.69,0:00:52.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stai, unde e butonul de pornire?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.53,0:00:55.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm... Poate e pe spate?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.16,0:00:58.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.70,0:00:59.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În față?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.58,0:01:03.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar o aluniță.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.13,0:01:06.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, mă simt ca o \Nadevărată perversă acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.84,0:01:08.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar nu o pot lăsa așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.97,0:01:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce e asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:15.51,0:01:17.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un cod QR!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:18.31,0:01:19.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate voi găsi niște informații.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.10,0:01:23.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vă mulțumim pentru achiziție!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.64,0:01:29.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Acest video vă va învăța tot ce trebuie să știți \Ndespre androidul vostru sexual, Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:29.61,0:01:31.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Să vedem cum o pornim.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:35.57,0:01:38.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oare chiar vreau s-o repornesc?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:38.74,0:01:41.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu vreau s-o arunc,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.29,0:01:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}dar poate ar fi mai \Nbine s-o las oprită.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.25,0:01:49.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, așa e, uitasem \Ncă am comandat asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.84,0:01:51.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:51.84,0:01:55.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pentru a o porni, \Nsărutați-o franțuzește
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.47,0:01:59.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}și apăsați ușor butonul din gura ei.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:03.56,0:02:07.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unde este? Unde este butonul?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.82,0:02:10.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stăpână?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.94,0:02:12.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te-ai trezit!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.61,0:02:15.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu te mai trezeai, deci îmi făceam \Ngriji că te-ai fi putut strica.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce ușurare.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.20,0:02:23.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am uitat complet \Nsă-mi reîncarc bateria.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.04,0:02:26.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E în regulă. Și eu ar fi \Ntrebuit să mă gândesc la asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.50,0:02:28.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar, mai întâi, uite.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.25,0:02:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine... Stăpână? Ce e asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.75,0:02:34.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aveam doar uniforma mea școlară care să ți \Nse potrivească, așa că ți-am cumpărat asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.34,0:02:36.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă așteptam să \Narate precum o costumație.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.72,0:02:39.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar îți vine minunat.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.89,0:02:41.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești așa adorabilă, Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.64,0:02:45.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tocmai mi-ai spus pe nume?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.23,0:02:48.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ai mai făcut asta până acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:48.73,0:02:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt așa de fericită.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.11,0:02:54.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog să-mi spui pe \Nnume în continuare.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.03,0:02:56.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh... Oh, nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.15,0:02:58.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}E așa de drăguță.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.74,0:03:02.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De acum înainte, voi intra în \Nmodul somn odată cu tine, stăpână.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.79,0:03:03.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.95,0:03:08.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă poți trezi la fel cum m-ai repornit.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.08,0:03:08.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.08,0:03:10.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În modul în care te-am repornit?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.25,0:03:12.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E o limitare funcțională deoarece \Nnu ești înregistrată ca stăpân.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.25,0:03:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă erai, trebuia \Ndoar să-mi spui numele.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.26,0:03:21.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci te poți înregistra ca stăpâna mea sau \Nmă poți trezi manual în fiecare dimineață.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.55,0:03:22.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pe care variantă o preferi?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.68,0:03:30.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(\fscx108\fscy108)\t(2890,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Pe niciuna!
